 "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":" = { true }, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"prose"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17GnustoMeleeCombat0bC0V","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat","text":"MeleeCombat"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17GnustoMeleeCombat0bC0V15AggressionProseV","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse","text":"AggressionProse"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TimedEvent","text":"TimedEvent"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"actor","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The villain who fights back each turn.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"key","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Ledger key sharing this villain’s health, stun and engagement","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"code":"villain","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"name","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Global timer name for the counter-attack daemon.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"strikesFirst","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The odds out of a hundred that he starts a fight on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"turn the player hasn’t. 100 fights on sight; 0 never starts one and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only ever answers a blow.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"playerStrength","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Hits the player survives before a wound turns fatal.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"condition","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An extra gate, checked first — a false gate is a quiet, draw-free turn.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"prose","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Per-Outcome counter-attack lines (miss, wound, playerDeath).","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The daemon rolling the villain’s counter-attack each turn."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"In a fight","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is the source’s "},{"code":"FIGHTBIT","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"code":"I-FIGHT","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"code":"1actions.zil:3810","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has a villain strike only once the player has engaged him or once his own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"F-FIRST?","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" branch says he starts one, and "},{"code":"strikesFirst","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is that branch,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out of a hundred: the troll’s is 33 ("},{"code":"1actions.zil:702","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), the thief’s 20"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":":2064","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and the cyclops, who has no such branch at all, is 0. A fight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either of them starts persists — both branches set "},{"code":"FIGHTBIT","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — and he"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"strikes in the turn he starts it rather than telegraphing it. "},{"code":"I-FIGHT","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"clears the bit on the villain the player is no longer standing with, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"walking out ends a fight and walking back in asks the question again."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Neither 0 nor 100 draws; see "},{"code":"startsAFight(chance:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"when:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is an extra gate evaluated before the same-room guard and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before any draw — so a villain whose combat is scoped (the thief only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fights in his lair) burns no randomness on the turns his gate is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closed, keeping every seeded draw sequence intact. It does "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" gate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"coming round, which happens first: a man knocked out where his gate is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shut still wakes up. Nor does it gate "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"disengaging","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", which is the room’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"business rather than the host’s — the source agrees, skipping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"engrossed thief’s turn without clearing his "},{"code":"FIGHTBIT","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — so a man"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"admiring a gift you handed him is still in the fight when he looks up."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Gates are assumed pure: they are asked once per turn and their answer is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":